NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for businesses across East Wales — online stores designed around your brand and built to sell. Based in Merthyr Tydfil, we work with clients across [Mold](/ecommerce-web-design-mold/), [Flint](/ecommerce-web-design-flint/), [Buckley](/ecommerce-web-design-buckley/), [Holywell](/ecommerce-web-design-holywell/), [Ruthin](/ecommerce-web-design-ruthin/), [Denbigh](/ecommerce-web-design-denbigh/), and the wider East Wales region.

## Platforms we build on

**Shopify** — reliable, scalable, minimal maintenance. Custom-designed.
**WooCommerce** — WordPress-based, highly flexible. Fully custom-designed.
**SureCart** — modern, ideal for digital products and subscriptions.

## What's included

- Fully custom design — no off-the-shelf themes
- Mobile-first development
- Secure checkout with payment gateway integration
- Easy product management
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics setup

We also offer [web design for East Wales businesses](/web-design-east-wales/), [local SEO in East Wales](/seo-east-wales/), and [logo design for East Wales businesses](/logo-design-east-wales/).

